Subject: [PATCH v6 04/11] media: mtk-jpeg: Get rid of mtk_smi_larb_get/put
Date: Wed, 14 Jul 2021 10:56:19 +0800
Message-ID: <20210714025626.5528-5-yong.wu@mediatek.com>
